{"id":"n28954-1-7","stage":2,"title":"직선 · 直线","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28954-1-7-1","ko":"화장실이 멀리 있나요?","zh":"洗手间在很远的地方吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"화장실이","meaning":"洗手间，卫生间","explanation":"화장실：洗手间，卫生间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"화장실","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30211","senseId":"1","lemma":"화장실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"멀리","meaning":"远远地，遥远地，久远地","explanation":"멀리：远远地，遥远地，久远地","readings":[{"term":"멀리","audio":"/audio/f62a38710e04901c3e13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54965","senseId":"1","lemma":"멀리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"在","explanation":"있다：在；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"8","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"477b8e1cccfde276","term":"화장실","zh":"洗手间，卫生间","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3","entryId":"30211","definition":"设有供大便和小便排出体外的设施的地方。","pronunciation":["화장실"]},{"id":"f62a38710e04901c","term":"멀리","zh":"远远地，遥远地，久远地","audio":"/audio/f62a38710e04901c3e13.mp3","entryId":"54965","definition":"时间或距离相隔颇远地。","pronunciation":["멀ː리"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"某物占有某处位置或空间。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/dd4d7b41637814221410.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28954-1-7-2","ko":"아니요, 화장실은 여기에서 직선 거리로 십여 미터밖에 안 돼요.","zh":"不，洗手间从这里算起，直线距离只有十几米而已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요,","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화장실은","meaning":"洗手间，卫生间","explanation":"화장실：洗手间，卫生间；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"화장실","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30211","senseId":"1","lemma":"화장실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기에서","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"직선","meaning":"直线","explanation":"직선：直线","readings":[{"term":"직선","audio":"/audio/44fba959571e74084d8b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28954","senseId":"1","lemma":"직선","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거리로","meaning":"距离","explanation":"거리：距离；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"거리","audio":"/audio/51e49276d394c94f94a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15826","senseId":"1","lemma":"거리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"십여","meaning":"十","explanation":"십：十；여：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89595","senseId":"1","lemma":"십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미터밖에","meaning":"米","explanation":"미터：米；밖에：与否定表达合用，表示“只有、除……之外没有”。","readings":[{"term":"미터","audio":"/audio/489fc50fd43c76e8813b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58160","senseId":"1","lemma":"미터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"内，以内","explanation":"안：内，以内","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"2","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼요.","meaning":"足够","explanation":"되다：足够；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"19","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"477b8e1cccfde276","term":"화장실","zh":"洗手间，卫生间","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3","entryId":"30211","definition":"设有供大便和小便排出体外的设施的地方。","pronunciation":["화장실"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"44fba959571e7408","term":"직선","zh":"直线","audio":"/audio/44fba959571e74084d8b.mp3","entryId":"28954","definition":"不弯曲并笔直伸展的线。","pronunciation":["직썬"]},{"id":"51e49276d394c94f","term":"거리","zh":"距离","audio":"/audio/51e49276d394c94f94a8.mp3","entryId":"15826","definition":"两个东西或场所等相隔的长度。","pronunciation":["거ː리"]},{"id":"c7470d030eddae16","term":"십","zh":"十","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3","entryId":"89595","definition":"十的。","pronunciation":["십"]},{"id":"489fc50fd43c76e8","term":"미터","zh":"米","audio":"/audio/489fc50fd43c76e8813b.mp3","entryId":"58160","definition":"长度单位。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"内，以内","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"74890","definition":"不超过一定的基准或界限的程度。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"足够","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"没关系，或没有问题。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7bd489e60b137a09e610.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.907,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28954","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":67,"sequenceScore":1.7337,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不，洗手间从这里算起，直线距离只有十几米而已。","洗手间在很远的地方吗？","我们快点过铁路道口吧。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["洗手间在很远的地方吗？","我们快点过铁路道口吧。","不，洗手间从这里算起，直线距离只有十几米而已。"],"answer":2}]}
